/*
 * Implements validation for `return` expressions in Ymir.
 *
 * A `return` expression exits the nearest enclosing function or lambda. It may
 * optionally carry a value. The return type of the function is determined
 * either:
 *
 *   - at function-entry(for normal functions), or
 *   - incrementally by return statements(for lambdas).
 *
 * <hr>
 *
 * @Package: ymirc
 * @Module: ymirc::semantic::validator::value::instruction::return_
 * @File: ymirc/semantic/validator/value/instruction/return_.yr
 * @Author(s):
 *   - Emile Cadorel <ecadorel@gmail.com>
 *
 * @Created(YYYY-MM-DD): 2026-03-27
 * @Copyright(C) 2021–2026 GNU-Ymir
 * @License
 *   ```text
